{"id":"662271","name":"鲜虾蔬菜汤","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/662271/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲜虾","amount":"3只"}],"sub":[{"name":"甘蓝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"甘蓝洗净切成丝。","img":"images/662271/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鲜虾洗净。","img":"images/662271/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中加入适量食用油烧热，下入胡萝卜丝、甘蓝丝翻炒。","img":"images/662271/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"翻炒至此状态即可。","img":"images/662271/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量开水，料酒、盐煮一下。","img":"images/662271/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再加入鲜虾稍煮即熟，加入适量鸡精。","img":"images/662271/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"出锅盛入碗中，蔬菜鲜虾汤，汤鲜味美。","img":"images/662271/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}